[Desktop Entry]
Name=Hearth COSMIC
Comment=Hearth OS: Game Mode and the Hearth COSMIC desktop (System76's COSMIC in Hearth's look). Saved as your desktop; falls back to Hearth Classic if COSMIC can't start.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/nimbus-session --desktop=cosmic
TryExec=start-cosmic
Type=Application
DesktopNames=Nimbus
